  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-起量管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"在账户满足一定条件时，创建优选起量任务，账户下生效的优选起量任务数量有且只有1个，且有正在进行的任务时不能创建新的任务。关键配合接口如【获取Access token】、【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"tools.task_raise.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/task_raise/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1733956164012035\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"获取Access token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"创建优选起量任务需要授权access_token，可通过此接口获取\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"附录-返回码\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"创建优选起量任务的应答中返回码和返回信息的说明需要参考此接口文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1733956164012035\",\"title\":\"新建优选起量任务\"}",
